cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite the preprints below."
title: "MS408 — a firewall-disciplined, self-correcting evaluator for Voynich-Manuscript hypotheses"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational toolkit and methodology for the Voynich Manuscript
  (Beinecke MS 408) and other ground-truth-free corpora. It does not propose a
  decipherment; it provides a cold, deterministic way to evaluate a hypothesis against
  the manuscript's statistical discriminator bands, with every axis's caveat attached,
  plus a documented adversarial-refutation protocol.
type: software
